From aea7270d7259ca9b6dbb79067e4aefcc35c5dff4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "erik.hauan" <erik.hauan@radiantvs.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:26:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] node-scanner, noderec: slot capacity, jit_load and
 observed-at on NVIDIA's modelInventory behind S1/S4/S5/S8

Behaviour: the scanner decodes slotsByEngine and jitLoadByEngine from a
node's /v1/models in the same pass as NVIDIA's fields and stamps the fetch
time (ModelsObservedAt) into the inventory; enrichment and its cached
fallback publish them on the directory node; applyModels stores them when
NVIDIA's compare (models, modelsByEngine, loadedByEngine, downloadedByEngine)
changed, when the capacity changed, or on the 30s observed-at heartbeat.

Seams used: S8 (enrich_hosts.go: modelInventory gains one field,
`local modelInventoryExt`; daemon.go fetchModels: the decode struct embeds
localModelsWire and the return literal sets `local: d.local.ext(...)`).
NVIDIA's #181 modelInventory, applyTo, fetchModels and 4-argument
applyModels are kept verbatim, so S8 is no longer a signature change and the
test call sites need no edit. S4 (daemon.go: `local *localScanState` and its
init; `inventory.local.applyTo(node)` and `cached.local.applyTo(node)` in
enrichModelsCandidates); NVIDIA's lastInventory cache now carries the
extension, so the migrate/forget/record/cached hooks are gone. S5
(directory.go: deferred localMergeCapacity exit hook). S1 (noderec.go:
LocalNodeExt embed after NVIDIA's new DownloadedByEngine/LastSeen). observedAt
lives in modelInventoryExt.observedAt, stamped at fetch by a non-nil
localScanState (0 with nil state).

Proving tests: TestS1_Nil, TestS4_Nil, TestS5_Nil, TestS8_Nil,
TestLocalDownloadedChangeKeepsCapacity, TestLocal*, TestRefreshSlotChangeReportsChange,
TestApplyModelsObservedAtHeartbeat (nvpair-node-scanner, nvpair-shared/noderec).

Feature-group commit for catch-up step 4, exported as
local/patches/001-scanner-slot-capacity.patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
